      "updated": 1784802116285,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Exercise 5.1: Design a register machine to compute factorials using the iterative algorithm\nspecified by the following procedure. Draw data-path and controller diagrams for this\nmachine.\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Exercise 5.1: Design a register machine to compute factorials using the iterative algorithm\nspecified by the following procedure. Draw data-path and controller diagrams for this\nmachine.\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "SPXxqtDhG-3VNnU3sUWcR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 377,
      "y": 252.5,
      "width": 416.2166748046875,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#343a40",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b4v",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 250672196,
      "version": 18,
      "versionNonce": 1658248060,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1784802202778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "(define (factorial n)\n    (define (iter product counter)\n        (if (> counter n)\n            product\n            (iter (* counter product) (+ counter 1))))\n    (iter 1 1))",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "(define (factorial n)\n    (define (iter product counter)\n        (if (> counter n)\n            product\n            (iter (* counter product) (+ counter 1))))\n    (iter 1 1))",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
